validasi referral.

Jika valid:

Referrer:
+5 XP

New Member:
+5 XP

New Member juga:

Registration Bonus:
+10 XP

Jadi:

New member total = 15 XP

Referrer = +5 XP

Semua dilakukan hanya satu kali.

